               <code code="55105-1" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="OTC - PURPOSE SECTION"/>
               <title>Purpose</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>
                     <br/>
PRODUCT FEATURES:
  <br/>
Effectively preventing and alleviating motion sickness for a smoother journey.
  <br/>
                  </paragraph>
               </text>
